      "id": "claim_7ecc86e0adea4310955b1f2c03fd4809",
      "statement": "API-06 Card Management API (v2.6, base path /cards/v2, Card Services domain, owned by Card Technology) manages card lifecycle using tokenized cardToken references; PAN data is tokenized and raw card numbers are never returned. Data classification is Restricted - PCI.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/apis/api-06-card-management-api.md#L1-L17",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7e2ad7a391e4dfac598633be40c5366d48bf8f3471326497cf709a82071d85ab:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b9644475f80e4b109b2797dbd7ff0a13",
      "statement": "API-06 documents four endpoints: GET /cards/{cardToken}, POST /cards/{cardToken}/lock, PUT /cards/{cardToken}/controls and POST /cards/{cardToken}/wallet-provisioning. Issuance, activation, unlock and replacement are described in the overview but have no documented endpoint.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/apis/api-06-card-management-api.md#L4-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:021c778aaba1adb5bd5424c27cf7259f1e6b8ad4eb00334d70f4675913979683:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9de8f00a104340e280fa84945abc764f",
      "statement": "API-06 uses OAuth scopes cards:read, cards:write and cards.controls:write, a rate limit of 800 requests/minute per client, and an SLO of 99.97% availability with p95 latency of 220 ms. The source does not map scopes to endpoints.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/apis/api-06-card-management-api.md#L15-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b4e94e4b0dbe565d5666a0dd0bee5ffac42118e329813e5f741cb23e2833836c:"
        }
