    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a92bab9b47b34c579ed29d9c40259719",
      "statement": "Spend controls cover merchant category (blockedCategories), amount (dailyLimit) and geography (allowedCountries); the response returns cardToken, controlsVersion and status. Geography controls arrived in v2.6 (2026-04) and co-brand partner scopes in v2.5 (2025-08).",
